WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:03.580
My attempt to infiltrate Libelle Castle failed due to

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:07.250
an unexpected encounter with Her Highness,
the Princess Ashuna.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:11.250
And during the scuffle,
Akari had disappeared off somewhere.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:18.750
Meanwhile, Momo uncovered proof that Manon Libelle
was involved in the production of monstrine,

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:22.750
but fell into an enemy trap that left her critically injured.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:19.750
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.290
<b><i>[Explosion]</i></b>

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:30.080
Thanks to the proof Momo found,
the knights have taken action to sequester Libelle Island.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:33.380
The time has come to confront Manon Libelle.

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:36.630
Around the same time,

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:39.630
I was in my true state that
Menou doesn't know about,

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.750
face-to-face with Miss Manon.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.210
I have to figure out...

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:50.670
Why so many things are happening now in Libelle
that never took place in my past regressions.

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:54.000
Aren't you scared?

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:57.420
Because you've suspended these people in time?

00:00:59.130 --> 00:01:01.130
No, not scared.

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:10.210
More importantly,
isn't there something you want to ask me?

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:13.130
So? Go ahead.

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:19.380
What is it you want to ask so badly that it
was worth leaving Miss Menou's side?

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:24.790
Last night, I snuck into your room to investigate...

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:28.000
But, it didn't help me figure anything out.

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.290
How do you know about me?

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:35.710
Because someone told me...

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:39.130
That you made the world Regress.

00:01:40.750 --> 00:01:44.080
And not just once or twice either, I take it?

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:46.710
Who told you that?

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:50.380
Pandæmonium.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:24.750
<b>Episode 10:</b>

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:24.750
<b>The Daughter of a Lost One</b>

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:35.540
Manon Libelle...

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:39.170
She may be more trouble than I expected.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.250
"Pandemonium"? You mean that fog?

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:46.580
A confinement of fog that has lasted a thousand years...

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:50.080
Would you believe me if I told you I dispelled it?

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.460
What?

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:54.420
I don't think that's possible.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.540
Indeed.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.630
It's not something the likes of me
could ever do anything about.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:03.540
I'm not looking to answer riddles, okay?

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:09.710
I've regressed countless times,
but none of this ever happened in Libelle before.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:16.250
You changed something, didn't you?
In order to take revenge for your mom.

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:19.380
Revenge for my mother?

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.460
I heard these people talking.

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:27.500
They said this only happened
because you wanted vengeance.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:33.630
It sounds like there's a slight misunderstanding,
so let me explain.

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:37.920
To tell you the truth, my mother was a Lost One.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.830
Then she was Japanese?

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:42.960
Yes...

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:47.040
But unlike you, she wasn't summoned by anyone.

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:51.580
She was guided here by the stars,
a "lost one" in the truest sense.

00:04:52.080 --> 00:04:56.580
I'm told the Fourth in this city were overjoyed at the time.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:03.040
They had managed to secure someone with a
Pure Concept outside of the Faust's knowledge.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:13.960
As the representative of the Fourth,
my father Count Libelle married the Lost One,

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:19.420
in order to keep her by his
side and make use of her power.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:24.790
However, my father didn't make my mother use her
power, not even once.

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:31.500
Because at some point,
he had truly fallen in love with her.

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:35.420
As you must know...

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:41.540
The more a Lost One uses her power,
the more she loses her memories.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:44.790
That was what my father was afraid of.

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:49.080
That my mother would forget
the time they spent together.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:53.380
A beautiful story, isn't it?

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:59.630
But you know,
stories like that always come with a cruel ending.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:01.960
Manon...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:06.210
You actually have an older sister, you know.

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:11.080
A bright, active girl who's full of energy...

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:22.960
M-Mother...?!

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.000
<b><i>Etheric Connect</i></b>

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:32.210
Hold that in like your life depends on it, Lost One.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:36.540
If you invoke that, your child will die.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:52.920
Roughly ten years ago,

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:58.250
my mother was murdered by an
Executioner who came here: Flare.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:06:59.880
That's your revenge?

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.880
Because Menou is the apprentice
of the one who killed your mom?

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:05.750
No.

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:08.170
I loved my mother,

00:07:08.170 --> 00:07:14.670
but I understand the Church's reasoning that
otherworlders' Pure Concepts are dangerous.

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.000
They had reason enough to kill her.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:21.130
So if it's revenge I'm after, I suppose it's against them.

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.670
My father convinced the Fourth not to worry,

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:29.750
because I would inherit my
mother's power in her stead.

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:33.420
So that my mother wouldn't have to use her power.

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:41.000
But I turned out to be an ordinary person,
and never inherited a Pure Concept.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:43.000
What did I tell you?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.080
I was told time and time again...
We should have... from the beginning!<b></b>

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:47.000
that I was "a letdown"

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:49.250
and "worthless."

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:52.790
So of course that twisted my personality.

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.630
That's why I wanted to become taboo...

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.630
Exactly like they expected of me.

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:04.000
There's no point in trying anything.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:08.830
Anyone suspended with my power
is shielded from external forces, so-

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.830
I want to live up to their expectations,

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:16.750
and prove just how idiotic those expectations were.

00:08:18.170 --> 00:08:21.290
I'm in my rebellious phase, you see.

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.210
I think I'm starting to understand.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:30.080
You... or the you in this instance of Time,
obtained a way to do that.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:34.210
That's why the happenings in
Libelle changed drastically.

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:38.040
<b><i>Chaos</i></b>

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:38.000
I was powerless as my ordinary self.

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:42.000
That's why I will now become taboo!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:47.000
<b><i>Ether: Living Sacrifice - Chaos Adhesion,</i></b>

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:47.000
<b><i>Pure Concept [Chaos] - Summon [I Spy a Little Shadow]</i></b>

00:08:56.460 --> 00:09:00.540
I thought so. This power is stronger than yours.

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:03.460
How...?

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:06.880
That's right! There was one exception.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.920
One thing my magecraft failed to stop.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:13.000
That white globule I saw in Garm's ceremonial hall.

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:17.080
Then her power is on par with that?

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:18.750
It seems you're out of time.

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:25.210
Menou?!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.580
M... Menou...

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:40.540
Oh... this... isn't... D-Don't think I'm being weird...

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.040
I just...

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:46.080
Wh-what do I do?
I showed myself in this state to Menou...

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:47.580
I'm sorry.

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:51.000
It was my mistake for letting you out of my sight.

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:55.080
I have a bunch of questions, but that can wait.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.210
O-okay.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.380
Hurry and get off this island.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:04.380
There are some knights keeping watch,
so ask them to get Pastor Sicilia for you.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:05.790
Understand?

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:07.460
What about you, Menou?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.500
I'm going to go apprehend Manon Libelle.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.330
My...

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:21.380
How nice of you to come out of your way.

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.460
I bid you welcome, Miss Menou.

00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:29.420
Manon Libelle, you've stepped into the realm of taboo.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.580
For that I must execute you.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:37.080
Oh, this is lovely, Miss Menou.

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:40.920
It's clear to me now that you've said that.

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:46.250
As of now, I've truly become free and independent.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.960
I will rebel against this world...

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.040
with this power I wield!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.420
I embody the Fourth,

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:59.000
who seek to liberate the world in the
name of freedom and independence!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:03.920
I have become what the Fourth is truly meant to be!

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:05.670
Hold on!

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:12.130
Please kill me as well, just like my mother!

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.540
Excuse me?

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:17.500
Why should I have to kill a little brat like you?

00:11:18.670 --> 00:11:21.880
I'm the child of my mother, a Lost One!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:23.080
I must have some power-

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.250
You don't.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:28.040
Pure Concepts adhere to the soul.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:32.670
And a soul, unlike the body,
is not genetic in the slightest.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.250
It belongs solely to the individual born with it.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.880
In short, you're not taboo.

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.830
I am taboo.

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:56.380
Come, Miss Menou.

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.330
Let us fight to our hearts' content.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.040
She stood me up, hmm?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:21.880
Though I find it hard to believe that Momo
would do this without good reason.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:24.420
Princess Ashuna!

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:28.960
Didn't I tell you to let me be unless it's an emergency?

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:33.710
Some of the Fourth have turned themselves in,
and there's a high-ranking one among them.

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:36.460
Is it Manon Libelle?

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:39.960
No, an elderly man.
Probably one of the original members.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:41.380
I see.

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:45.170
Then I'll go with you.

00:13:17.920 --> 00:13:19.670
How lovely, Miss Menou.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.750
Those eyes... I can't get enough of them...

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:37.500
It's over.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:38.670
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:39.880
<b><i>[Gale]</i></b>

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.790
Oh, my...

00:13:52.920 --> 00:13:54.250
I win.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:57.670
Well, this is as good as I can do...

00:13:57.670 --> 00:14:04.170
But, it was so much better than
continuing to do nothing with my life.

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:07.420
This has been fun, Miss Menou.

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:09.630
It wasn't fun for me.

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:10.880
I see...

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:14.790
You don't like killing people, do you?

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:20.630
These roles in life, they're reprehensible, aren't they?

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:26.000
That's exactly why,
when trying to break free of restraints,

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:29.830
the people in this world turn to things that are taboo.

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:34.630
And you think that justifies you becoming taboo?

00:14:34.960 --> 00:14:36.380
Of course not.

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.040
All I want to say...

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:41.630
is that you're allowed to change too, Miss Menou.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:46.960
Like anyone else,
you have the right to rebel against the world.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.830
If you wished it of her,

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.670
I'm sure Miss Akari would be happy
to use her powers for you.

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:53.630
Don't you dare say that!

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.920
You're surprisingly transparent.

00:14:58.880 --> 00:15:05.750
But she said "countless times,"
so perhaps it's you who should be helping her change.

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:08.130
What are you talking about?

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:13.000
It's my policy not to divulge another girl's secrets.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:19.830
Miss Menou, you've come after the wrong person.

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.670
You can come out now.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:30.420
<b><i>Ether: Living Sacrifice - Chaos Adhesion,</i></b>

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:30.420
<b><i>Pure Concept [Chaos] - Summon [Happy Birthday to Me]</i></b>

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:30.290
Let me be the final sacrifice I offer you.

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:45.540
There's nothing you could have done... Miss Menou.

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:50.460
Things were already set in motion
long before you got here.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:56.250
The only reason I was able to produce
monstrine was thanks to this girl.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.790
Best of luck, Miss Menou.

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:04.210
Unlike me, she's more than just a handful.

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:28.210
I'm glad to see you're safe, Ms. Akari.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.630
I'm sorry to have worried you.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:31.670
It's fine.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:34.960
We'll shelter you at the church.
Please come with me.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:35.880
All right.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:43.330
Maa! The sky is so blue. And big!

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:48.000
It's such nice weather today!
I'm sure it's going to be a lovely day.

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:50.920
Right? Don't you think so, too?

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:55.920
You worked so hard for me!

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:59.630
Thanks for providing me with a
decent number of sacrifices.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.460
Hello there, Miss!

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.580
Meeting new people is one of my favorite things!

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:19.170
Is she using her own death as the
sacrifice required to summon herself?

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:22.750
If so, in a different sense from Akari,

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:24.000
she can't be killed.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.080
You must be a priestess!

00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:29.630
Is the girl with the cherry blossom pink hair okay?

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:32.880
I hope she's fine and didn't succumb to the poison!

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:38.170
I don't suppose you're a demon
summoned by Manon Libelle?

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:39.880
Of course not!

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:43.750
I'm human!
From the top of my head to the tips of my toes!

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.040
Yes...

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.000
You probably are human, technically.

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:53.750
This impossibly vile conjuring is
definitely that of a Pure Concept.

00:17:53.750 --> 00:17:56.920
An entity that crossed the line as a Lost One...

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.420
The most taboo of taboos...

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:01.330
A Human Error.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:04.130
Must I repeat myself again?!

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:07.830
We were all forced to do Manon Libelle's bidding!

00:18:08.080 --> 00:18:09.790
We are the victims here!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.710
"Forced to," eh?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.920
It's true!

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:18.080
The girl even laced our council's food with monstrine!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.210
With monstrine?

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:23.670
A Human Error.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.710
The remnant of what was once a Lost One.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.080
The worst monster imaginable.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.540
That's awful! Don't call me a monster!

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:38.580
You know, I did a bunch of practice inside that
girl and finally learned how to talk again!

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:40.500
So I want to chat some more!

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:46.080
The things I love more than anything are
singing and dancing and watching movies!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:51.540
I have no time for that.
Because my job is to kill entities like you.

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:55.130
Kill who? Me?

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:56.960
Yes, I'm going to destroy it.

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:59.170
Your Pure Concept, that is.

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:02.460
That's my meaning in life, after all.

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:10.420
Maa! Maa, you'll "destroy it"? My Pure Concept?!

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:12.330
Wow, amazing!

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:16.920
Oh. But it's true I'm super weak and I die really easily.

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.630
Still, you can't.

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:24.080
I mean, not even the Ivory hero managed to destroy me.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.500
"Ivory hero"?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.420
Maa! You don't know?!

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.920
But it was so amazing!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:34.790
The strongest, greatest Pure Concept
ever in all of humankind!

00:19:34.960 --> 00:19:42.130
A hero who was forced into protecting this stupid world!
But no one remembers?

00:19:42.130 --> 00:19:44.000
When the hero did so much for the world?

00:19:45.710 --> 00:19:50.000
That's why I think I remember hating you all.

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:52.210
Hate us for all I care.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.210
I haven't met someone like you in a long time!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:03.540
Thank you for coming on this wonderful day, everyone.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:08.420
I welcome you to beat, crush,
and mash me up as you see fit.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:14.080
There's more than enough of me so don't hold back.
Cast your inhibitions aside!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:18.920
What you're about to witness is a B movie screening.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:21.710
The entertainment of gods and
demons determined by dice!

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:27.710
Demons! Monsters! Dark Lords!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:32.080
Mysterious wonders both divine and demonic.
The dice are governed by chance.

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:35.380
Who knows what will happen next?!

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:49.630
<b><i>Ether: Living Sacrifice - Chaos Adhesion,</i></b>

00:20:45.210 --> 00:20:49.630
<b><i>Pure Concept [Chaos] - Summon [Can I Call a Hundred Friends?]</i></b>

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:00.710
I sense a conjuring!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.960
It's so massive... and twisted.

00:21:14.040 --> 00:21:17.210
Sacrificed... because of the monstrine?

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:47.130
Fear, excitement, and thrills-the triple package!

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:50.040
The singing, dancing,

